cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use scINTILLA in your work, please cite the preprint below."
title: "scINTILLA: Single-Cell Integrated Inference, Labelling, and Landscape Analysis"
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/soumickmj/scINTILLA"
url: "https://github.com/soumickmj/scINTILLA"
abstract: >-
  scINTILLA scores the learnability and internal consistency of cell-type labels
  in single-cell RNA-seq datasets by combining an unsupervised arm (a panel of
  clustering algorithms, neighbourhood confusion and fragmentation) with a
  supervised arm (classifier agreement, entropy and confidence), and benchmarks
  methods across the analysis workflow.
